announcement-admin-uplink-failure-text = Emergency Shuttle uplink failure, shuttle disabled until further notice.

announcement-admin-uplink-restored-text = Emergency Shuttle uplink reestablished, shuttle enabled.

announcement-admin-shuttle-override-title = Shuttle Trajectory Override

