announcement-anon-restored-text = Names and Identities have been restored.

announcement-anon-finance-title = Finance Report

announcement-anon-finance-text = As punishment for this station's poor productivity when compared to neighbor stations, names and identities will be restricted until further notice.

announcement-anon-wizard-title = Memetic Hazard

announcement-anon-wizard-text = Your station has been caught by a Wizard Federation Memetic Hazard. You are not y0urself, and yo% a2E 34!NOT4--- Welcome to the Academy, apprentices!

announcement-anon-spider-title = New Management

announcement-anon-spider-text = Your station has been sold out to the Spider Clan. Your new designations will be applied now.

announcement-anon-reality-text = Confirmed level 9 reality error event near { $station }. All personnel must try their best to carry on, as to not trigger more reality events by accident.
